     "claim_text": "Agua Prieta, Sonora (across from Douglas, Arizona), November 2017: Mexican authorities seized a van with a homemade air cannon ('bazooka') built into it, which they believed was meant to fire drug packages over the border fence into Arizona. Narration: 'Smugglers built a drug cannon into a van.' Headline 'A DRUG CANNON / AIMED AT ARIZONA'.",
